--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -62,0 +63,8 @@ You'll be prompted to enter your server URL. Kino automatically detects whether
+### Jellyfin playback progress
+
+With native mpv on macOS or Linux, Kino saves playback progress to Jellyfin every
+five seconds, when pausing, and when mpv closes. Keep Kino running while watching.
+Enter fetches the latest saved position before playing, even if the library view
+has older data; `p` starts from the beginning. Jellyfin's configured minimum and
+maximum resume percentages still apply.
+
